     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "武官、師長至軍長",
      "en": "Attaché, division and corps command"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "法爾肯霍斯特在1933至1935年擔任德國駐外公使館的武官；自1936年10月起指揮第32步兵師，1939年8月起出任第21軍軍長。",
      "en": "Falkenhorst served as military attaché at German legations from 1933 to 1935, commanded the 32nd Infantry Division from October 1936, and from August 1939 was commanding general of XXI Army Corps."
     },
