     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "波蘭戰役：法爾肯霍斯特集群",
      "en": "Poland 1939: Group Falkenhorst"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "波蘭戰役中，第21軍以其指揮官之名改稱法爾肯霍斯特集群，並於9月7日投入戰鬥；挪威百科亦記載他在波蘭戰役中任第21軍的指揮將領。",
      "en": "In the Polish campaign XXI Corps was redesignated Group Falkenhorst after its commander and was committed on 7 September; the Norwegian encyclopedia also records him as corps commander in that campaign."
     },
