     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "入侵與占領挪威",
      "en": "Invasion and occupation of Norway"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1940年2月20日希特勒接見他，其後他率軍於4月9日起占領挪威；第21軍於3月擴編為第21集團軍群，他自1940年4月至1944年12月擔任德軍在挪威的軍事首長，1944年12月18日被解職。",
      "en": "Hitler received him on 20 February 1940; his army group, expanded in March from XXI Corps, occupied Norway from 9 April. He was the Wehrmacht's military chief in Norway from April 1940 to December 1944 and was removed on 18 December 1944."
     },
