     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "戰後審判與釋放",
      "en": "Postwar trial and release"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1946年他遭英國軍事法庭起訴並判處死刑，後獲減刑為二十年徒刑，並於1953年因病獲釋。",
      "en": "In 1946 a British military court tried him and sentenced him to death; the sentence was later commuted to 20 years and he was released in 1953 because of illness."
     },
